WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:06.020
<b>Host
Sakai Masato
Sakaguchi Ango published <i>In the Woods Beneath the Cherry Blossoms in Full Bloom</i> in 1947.</b>

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:07.570
This work was actually based
on Ango's personal experience.

00:00:07.570 --> 00:00:10.610
<b>Photo: Shigeru Tamura
Ango Sakaguchi</b>

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:11.690
<b>Ango Sakaguchi
Photo: Shigeru Tamura</b>

00:00:11.690 --> 00:00:13.280
It happened during the war.

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:13.860
<b>Ango Sakaguchi
Photo: Shigeru Tamura</b>

00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:17.120
Under a cherry blossom tree in Ueno,

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:18.160
Ango witnessed the victims of the
Great Tokyo Air Raid being burned.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:21.370
The victims being burned

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:27.880
In his essay, he recorded his feelings of that time as such:

00:00:29.880 --> 00:00:34.470
When the victims of the Great Tokyo Air Raid
were gathered in the Ueno mountains and burned,

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:37.550
the cherry blossoms were in full bloom,

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:41.060
and only wind blew through the deserted woods.

00:00:41.850 --> 00:00:45.020
The tense silence made me want to run away.

00:00:46.900 --> 00:00:51.400
What did Ango think of cherry blossoms in the fullness of their bloom?

00:00:52.280 --> 00:00:52.990
The
masterpieces
are blue

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:55.030
The masterpieces are blue.

00:00:55.030 --> 00:00:55.950
The
masterpieces
are blue

00:00:56.110 --> 00:01:00.030
This is the last episode of <i>In the Woods Beneath the Cherry Blossoms in Full Bloom</i>.

00:01:04.830 --> 00:01:08.330
What Happened
Last Time

00:01:12.170 --> 00:01:16.380
Shigemaru, a bandit stronger than anyone else.

00:01:16.380 --> 00:01:20.810
He's extremely afraid of the cherry
blossoms when they're in full bloom.

00:01:22.600 --> 00:01:26.890
Then, a beautiful woman appeared before him.

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:30.690
He fell in love with her at first sight.

00:01:31.820 --> 00:01:37.570
However, she told him to kill his wives.

00:01:37.570 --> 00:01:42.160
Shigemaru obeyed her since he was in love.

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:46.000
From today on, you'll be my wife.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:47.460
If I'm your wife, carry me on your back.

00:01:47.460 --> 00:01:48.960
I can't walk on this mountain path.

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:50.290
What's with that woman?

00:01:50.290 --> 00:01:51.210
Where did he find her?

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:52.630
Who are these women?

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:57.010
I think that if I close my eyes,
those women will disappear on their own.

00:01:57.010 --> 00:01:57.880
Do you mind killing them?

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:58.880
What's with you?

00:01:58.880 --> 00:02:00.470
Do I really have to kill them?

00:02:00.470 --> 00:02:03.600
You killed my husband, but you can't kill your own wives?

00:02:03.600 --> 00:02:06.680
If you don't, I won't be your wife.

00:02:09.850 --> 00:02:14.030
The same as in those woods beneath the cherry blossoms in full bloom.

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:28.710
Hey Shigemaru, let's move to the city.

00:02:28.710 --> 00:02:33.130
If you're really a strong man, you'll take me to the city.

00:02:33.590 --> 00:02:37.010
Do you know what kind of wind the city has?

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:40.550
Do you understand my feelings now that that wind has been taken from me?

00:02:43.300 --> 00:02:45.640
Please wait three days.

00:02:45.970 --> 00:02:47.390
Three days?

00:02:47.390 --> 00:02:49.560
What happens in three days?

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:51.600
The cherry blossoms will bloom.

00:03:29.930 --> 00:03:33.480
Half a year has passed since we moved to the city.

00:03:33.480 --> 00:03:36.940
I feared the citizens just like one would fear the charms of combs and hairpins.

00:03:36.940 --> 00:03:38.650
That fear was not dread,

00:03:39.490 --> 00:03:41.610
but rather shyness and uneasiness towards the unknown.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:45.530
I felt ashamed of fearing everything I saw.

00:03:45.530 --> 00:03:49.080
Now that I think about it,

00:03:50.080 --> 00:03:55.750
when I was in the mountains, I didn't even have to think about which way the sky above the city was.

00:03:55.750 --> 00:03:59.000
I had no reason to fear or be ashamed.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:03.260
However, now there is nothing but hostility around me.

00:04:03.260 --> 00:04:06.720
Numerous travelers in the city...

00:04:06.720 --> 00:04:08.010
...how noisy.

00:04:08.010 --> 00:04:09.810
Aren't there too many oxen?

00:04:09.810 --> 00:04:11.270
What's going on in the city?

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.310
The oxen have conquered us!

00:04:14.310 --> 00:04:16.190
There's no way this is real!

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:17.690
Hey, change it back!

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:19.230
Make it normal again!

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:22.570
That's right.

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:23.700
This is the city.

00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:25.660
It's nothing special.

00:04:25.660 --> 00:04:27.780
Everyone puts on airs,

00:04:27.780 --> 00:04:30.580
and only cares about their appearance.

00:04:33.040 --> 00:04:34.750
Even though I say that,

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:37.170
pathetically, this is me now.

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:39.130
I can't hunt here,

00:04:39.130 --> 00:04:41.210
but I don't have enough knowledge to trade.

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:43.840
Although I imitate the citizens with my clothes,

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:47.340
everyone probably sees I'm a countryman.

00:04:47.340 --> 00:04:49.600
Excuse me.

00:04:50.060 --> 00:04:51.470
Please let me through.

00:04:51.470 --> 00:04:52.810
Sorry.

00:04:53.850 --> 00:04:54.560
Grandfather!

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:57.480
Why?!

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.150
It smells like my dead husband!

00:04:59.150 --> 00:05:00.780
It smells like a dead countryman!

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:02.360
Stop that, fool!

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:02.900
You called me?

00:05:02.900 --> 00:05:04.320
Someone, help!

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.570
There's a countryman!

00:05:09.530 --> 00:05:10.280
A bumpkin!

00:05:10.280 --> 00:05:11.160
Lame!

00:05:11.910 --> 00:05:12.450
Hey!

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:13.290
What? What?

00:05:13.290 --> 00:05:14.000
A guy from the country?

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:15.080
Let me see! Let me see!

00:05:15.080 --> 00:05:16.040
Where? Where?

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.210
This guy's bad!

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.250
Doesn't he look like a mountain beast?

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:21.170
Why did he come here?

00:05:21.170 --> 00:05:22.090
Go back to the mountains!

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:22.880
Yeah!

00:05:23.300 --> 00:05:26.050
Do you know what kind of wind the city has?

00:05:29.510 --> 00:05:33.430
Do you understand my feelings now that that wind has been taken from me?

00:05:34.730 --> 00:05:36.140
If you don't, Shigemaru,

00:05:38.190 --> 00:05:40.650
I won't become your wife.

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:57.000
There's only one thing I've understood.

00:05:57.000 --> 00:05:58.670
The citizens are noisy.

00:05:59.960 --> 00:06:03.670
The mountain beasts were so much quieter.

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:19.190
Welcome home.

00:06:21.940 --> 00:06:25.440
Don't you want to go back to the mountains?

00:06:25.440 --> 00:06:25.990
Huh?

00:06:29.070 --> 00:06:30.030
Well, never mind.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:31.450
Keep up the good work.

00:06:59.230 --> 00:06:59.850
You...

00:07:02.810 --> 00:07:03.480
You're good.

00:07:06.280 --> 00:07:07.440
But...

00:07:07.440 --> 00:07:09.820
How about this?!

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:20.750
What's the meaning of this?

00:07:21.000 --> 00:07:22.460
Hey, won't you die?

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:23.250
Please!

00:07:23.250 --> 00:07:24.250
Why?

00:07:24.250 --> 00:07:26.750
Because you don't bring anything home!

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:29.880
We moved to the city, but it's just like it was in the mountains!

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:33.890
But we have to find a way to earn money first!

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:35.180
What was what?

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:36.970
Saying that doesn't change a thing!

00:07:36.970 --> 00:07:38.180
The way you ask...

00:07:38.180 --> 00:07:40.890
It means use this and go bring something back.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:42.060
This.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:48.400
Are you telling me to kill again?

00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:50.690
I didn't say that.

00:07:50.690 --> 00:07:52.030
Well, I'll leave it to you.

00:07:53.660 --> 00:07:55.780
Anyway, Shigemaru.

00:07:56.700 --> 00:08:02.620
Combs and hairpins can be
found in all of the city houses.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:06.210
I'm not just asking you to bring them here.

00:08:07.290 --> 00:08:09.000
What are you afraid of?

00:08:10.260 --> 00:08:11.550
You can do that, right?

00:09:07.020 --> 00:09:09.520
I'm sad, princess.

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.940
I want to embrace you in my arms,

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:14.950
but I lack a body to do so!

00:09:14.950 --> 00:09:17.160
You're so kind, dear husband.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.410
I'm out of patience.

00:09:18.410 --> 00:09:20.910
Then let's kiss.

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:21.580
See?

00:09:27.210 --> 00:09:28.830
So pitiful.

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:30.590
Miserable.

00:09:33.010 --> 00:09:37.840
It's so thoughtful of you to bring me toys and such.

00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.390
I just took the opportunity.

00:09:39.390 --> 00:09:42.060
Then bring someone to be the villain.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:43.350
A villain?

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:46.020
I want a more hateful head!

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:48.480
Like...

00:09:49.400 --> 00:09:51.360
A bald priest's head!

00:09:53.610 --> 00:09:54.860
You can do it, right?

00:10:05.200 --> 00:10:07.710
Strike with a sword, and the head will come falling down.

00:10:07.710 --> 00:10:09.040
That's all.

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:12.340
I gathered heads every night.

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:03.010
And she played with those heads day by day.

00:11:03.010 --> 00:11:04.220
The heads fell in love.

00:11:04.220 --> 00:11:06.060
The heads sulked and lied.

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.850
The heads were choked in sorrow.

00:11:07.850 --> 00:11:08.980
So stupid!

00:11:12.600 --> 00:11:15.940
A woman's wish is like a bird flying in a straight line.

00:11:15.940 --> 00:11:18.440
The never-ending repetition of light and darkness!

00:11:18.440 --> 00:11:19.320
It's endless!

00:12:21.300 --> 00:12:22.880
The sky is falling!

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:24.970
The never-ending cycle of light and darkness is falling!

00:12:24.970 --> 00:12:27.640
Can I end this repetition by killing her?

00:12:28.390 --> 00:12:30.770
But if I kill her, I'll die myself!

00:12:31.520 --> 00:12:33.020
That woman is me.

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.650
Why must you drop the sky?!

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:38.110
What the hell am I thinking?

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:26.990
<b>In the Woods
Beneath the
Cherry Blossoms
in Full Bloom</b>

00:13:31.370 --> 00:13:34.370
I totally forgot him too!

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:37.000
I even asked: "Who are you?"

00:13:37.000 --> 00:13:39.250
It was so embarrassing!

00:13:42.050 --> 00:13:43.300
Welcome back!

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:58.770
Where have you been?

00:13:58.770 --> 00:14:00.060
I've been waiting for you!

00:14:01.480 --> 00:14:04.230
This time I want a shrine maiden's head!

00:14:05.150 --> 00:14:07.070
A shrine maiden's, or maybe a nurse's!

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.610
Overflowing with the spirit of service!

00:14:08.610 --> 00:14:11.370
A lewd body wrapped in formal clothes!

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:12.530
Moe!

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:13.990
You like that as well, right?

00:14:13.990 --> 00:14:15.750
All men like cosplay!

00:14:15.750 --> 00:14:16.540
No way!

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:18.210
Pervert!

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:19.580
I don't want to.

00:14:24.000 --> 00:14:25.420
What did you say?

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:27.090
I said I don't want to.

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:29.840
Did you get cold feet?

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.470
You're quite the sissy.

00:14:32.470 --> 00:14:34.260
That's not it.

00:14:34.260 --> 00:14:36.220
I came to hate it because it's endless.

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.690
Everything is endless.

00:14:38.690 --> 00:14:41.980
Isn't eating every day endless?

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:45.530
Isn't falling asleep every day endless?

00:14:45.530 --> 00:14:46.820
That's different.

00:14:46.820 --> 00:14:48.070
In what way?

00:14:51.530 --> 00:14:53.030
Well, whatever.

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:55.870
I've decided to go back to the mountains.

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:01.120
You're leaving me behind?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.880
I hate the city.

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:06.300
Don't you have me?

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:10.260
You can only live in the city, right?

00:15:10.760 --> 00:15:13.010
I can only live in the mountains.

00:15:13.010 --> 00:15:15.260
You don't have me in the mountains!

00:15:15.680 --> 00:15:18.020
When did you become so cruel?

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.270
It's not that.

00:15:20.270 --> 00:15:22.270
I just can't live in the city.

00:15:22.270 --> 00:15:24.400
Did you come to hate me?

00:15:24.400 --> 00:15:28.400
Why did such terrible thoughts wander into your heart?!

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:30.950
It's not my fault.

00:15:30.950 --> 00:15:33.530
Anyway, everything is the city's fault.

00:15:33.530 --> 00:15:35.080
Hate the city, not me.

00:15:51.380 --> 00:15:52.930
Crap, crap, crap!

00:15:56.510 --> 00:15:57.560
What are you doing?!

00:16:07.940 --> 00:16:10.070
What... are you doing?

00:16:10.820 --> 00:16:15.280
I thought only of you while you were away.

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:17.530
I see.

00:16:17.530 --> 00:16:18.830
I was lonely.

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:21.290
That's why I asked you to do all this.

00:16:22.290 --> 00:16:23.040
I see.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:24.460
Sorry.

00:16:32.300 --> 00:16:33.880
If you go back to the mountains,

00:16:34.550 --> 00:16:36.510
I'll go with you.

00:16:37.890 --> 00:16:38.930
Really?

00:16:38.930 --> 00:16:44.100
I can't live even a day without you.

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:49.020
But there aren't any of your
beloved heads in the mountains.

00:16:49.020 --> 00:16:53.030
If I have to choose between you and the heads,

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:55.700
I'll give up the heads.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.160
Sorry.

00:16:59.160 --> 00:17:00.040
Thank you.

00:17:02.660 --> 00:17:03.330
Thank you.

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:22.720
Get on.

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:23.560
No thanks.

00:17:23.560 --> 00:17:24.940
I can walk by myself.

00:17:25.770 --> 00:17:26.520
Just do it.

00:17:32.440 --> 00:17:33.320
Here we go.

00:17:37.490 --> 00:17:39.780
The weather is nice today!

00:17:39.780 --> 00:17:40.330
Yeah!

00:17:44.450 --> 00:17:47.580
You were carrying me on the first day we met too.

00:17:49.210 --> 00:17:51.250
I just recalled that too.

00:18:09.520 --> 00:18:10.980
Hey, you can see them.

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:14.110
These mountains are all mine!

00:18:17.530 --> 00:18:20.070
Don't laugh, listen...

00:18:22.240 --> 00:18:31.250
Everything you see, from the mountains to the trees
to the valleys to the clouds in those valleys, is mine.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:35.260
I'll be back soon, please wait.

00:18:49.350 --> 00:18:52.270
<b>Where are these petals falling from?</b>

00:18:55.650 --> 00:19:01.530
<b>You see,
all of these flowers in full bloom
are spreading out high in the sky.
Yet not a single petal has touched the ground.</b>

00:19:08.580 --> 00:19:09.540
<b>He immediately realized</b>

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.540
<b>that the woman is a demon.</b>

00:19:32.270 --> 00:19:37.400
The cherry blossoms are in full bloom

00:19:44.990 --> 00:19:51.620
and gathering the emotion of love.

00:19:59.130 --> 00:20:03.590
Beneath the cherry blossoms,

00:20:11.390 --> 00:20:16.520
child's play is for your dreams...

00:22:07.630 --> 00:22:12.810
<b>beneath the cherry blossoms in full bloom.
Still, no one understands the secret of the woods</b>

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:19.350
<b>Maybe it's the thing called "loneliness".</b>

00:23:25.000 --> 00:23:30.010
Next Time
Kokoro           Summer
